      "key": [
        "Wonderland Cosmosphere",
        "Cosmosphere"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Wonderland Manekin: The Wonderland Cosmosphere",
      "content": "The Wonderland Cosmosphere is a glittering crystal ball set with star-shaped gems, described as one of the keys to the Miliastra Wonderland. The Hexenzirkel awarded it to the Traveler after the trial in The Gardener (Paralogism, 5.6), and Venti delivered it. He said it held something one of a kind that would reveal itself when the time was right. In 6.1 the orb \"blossoms with light\" and opens the way to the Wonderland, where the Traveler awakens their Manekin.",
