      "comment": "Wonderland Manekin: Manekin and Manekina",
      "content": "The gift is a pair of avatars: the male Manekin and the female Manekina. Inside the Wonderland the owner can switch between them freely. In Teyvat both are kept as separate party members, but they cannot fight in the same team. Each is named and styled separately, and each has three voice options.",
