      "comment": "Wonderland Manekin: Manekin cosmetics and Octavia's travels",
      "content": "Manekins wear Cosmetics: tops, bottoms, footwear, headwear, many accessories, hairstyles and makeup. These are saved as Cosmetic Plans. Many set descriptions tell small stories of Octavia's journeys across other worlds. She slept through the polar days and nights of a 273rd planet in sleepwear from a 118th. She also advised on a \"Super Tour\" linking Teyvat-style theme parks on a 712th planet.",
